<title>USA: United Security Bancorp names CEO.</title>
<headline>United Security Bancorp names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Security Bancorp said Friday it named former Farmers &amp; Merchants Bank executive, Duane Brandenburg, as president and chief executive officer of its United Security Bank subsidiary.</p>
<p>Brandenburg replaces Robert McKean who was named president, executive officer, and a director of USB in March 1995.</p>
